@ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5245

# Cole os accessTokens devolvidos por POST /login para usuarios com cada role.
@employeeToken = <token-employee>
@approverToken = <token-approver>
@financeToken = <token-finance>
@auditorToken = <token-auditor>

GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

# Os endpoints do checkpoint estão definidos em docs/REQUISITOS.md.

### Cadastro (nunca aceita role)
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "funcionario@empresa.com",
  "password": "<senha-do-usuario>"
}

### Login
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "funcionario@empresa.com",
  "password": "<senha-do-usuario>"
}

### Criar rascunho (Employee). Proprietario, estado e horarios vem do servidor.
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "description": "Taxi para reuniao com cliente",
  "amount": 45.50,
  "expenseDate": "2026-10-01"
}

### Editar rascunho proprio (somente em Draft)
PUT {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "description": "Taxi ida e volta para reuniao com cliente",
  "amount": 60.00,
  "expenseDate": "2026-10-01"
}

### Enviar rascunho (Draft -> Submitted)
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Aprovar reembolso enviado (Approver; nao pode ser o proprietario)
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}

### Reprovar reembolso enviado com justificativa (Approver; nao pode ser o proprietario)
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{approverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "justification": "Comprovante fiscal esta ilegivel."
}

### Pagar reembolso aprovado (Finance; nao pode ser o proprietario)
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}

### Listar reembolsos visiveis ao perfil
GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}

### Consultar detalhe (fora do escopo de leitura retorna 404)
GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}

### Consultar historico (mesma visibilidade do detalhe)
GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}
